              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "55aaf4d3-f7e3-4a3e-9196-01a6f7474f94"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582782,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Role in Impressionism</strong><br>\nAlthough Manet is often associated with the Impressionists, he maintained a distinctive style that set him apart. He influenced the movement with his loose brushwork and emphasis on light but never fully embraced all its techniques.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Painting Technique</strong><br>\nManet's technique was revolutionary for his use of black as a color, his flat application of paint, and his choice of everyday scenes. He brought a new life to subjects with his dynamic brushstrokes and emphasis on the surface texture of the canvas.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Late Recognition</strong><br>\nIn his later years, Manet began to receive more official recognition, including an award at the Paris Salon, which had previously rejected his work. His paintings started to be appreciated by a broader audience, and he was acknowledged as an important figure in the art world.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "3b13867b-feab-4e2e-bfa2-fcc82e4dbff1"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
